          "en": "Cloudflare announced Clef, a set of open-weight AI models designed to choose between predefined options rather than generate text, releasing 9B- and 27B-parameter versions with an adaptation platform.",
          "zh": "Cloudflare 发布了 Clef，一套开源权重 AI 模型，旨在在预定义选项中进行选择而非生成文本，并推出了 9B 和 27B 参数版本以及一个适配平台。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
