            "These models are designed to choose between predefined options, distinguishing them from text generation models.",
            "Cloudflare released models with 9B and 27B parameters, along with a platform for adapting them to specific decision-making tasks."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "Cloudflare 在其“生日周”期间宣布了“Clef”，一套开源权重 AI 模型。",
            "这些模型旨在从预定义选项中进行选择，而非生成文本，这使其与文本生成模型不同。",
            "Cloudflare 发布了 9B 和 27B 参数的模型，以及一个用于将它们适应特定决策任务的平台。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
